From e742ba9699dccad6ee22c63fba4d28e441270649 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 08:30:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Turn SKIPAPP into a social savings circle with pastel
 redesign

- Pastel color palette (mint/lavender/peach/pink) across all screens
- New "circle" feature backed by Firebase Auth + Firestore: create/join
  a circle via invite code, live member list showing each friend's
  skips/streak/savings, and a shared feed of what everyone skipped
- Personal savings goals (title, target amount, what it's for) with
  progress bars on the dashboard and goal screen
- Basic content moderation: blocklist filter on names/descriptions/goals
  plus a report button that auto-hides feed posts after 2 reports
- Added login screen and email/password registration for cross-device sync
- Updated FIREBASE-SETUP guide with Auth + Firestore setup and security rules
